    <briefdescription>
<para>AWS S3 Blob Storage Backend. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores blobs in an AWS S3 bucket (or any S3-compatible object store) using the AWS SDK for C++ v3.</para>
<para>The backend is conditionally compiled behind THEMIS_HAS_AWS_SDK. When the SDK is absent the constructor marks the instance as unavailable and all operations return an error, so no unimplemented path is reachable at runtime.</para>
<para>Authentication uses the standard AWS credential chain (environment variables, ~/.aws/credentials, instance-profile metadata).</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
